      "message": "This broke the volteer build on gitlab: https://gitlab.com/zephyr-ec/ec/-/jobs/2201025647\n\nIn the zephyr sdk, an empty array can\u0027t be dereferenced at all, even if those calls would always get optimized out. \n\nThe compiler there can figure out that \n```\npwm \u003d \u0026pwm_configs[i];\n```\n\nwill always fail, because sizeof(pwm_configs) \u003d\u003d 0, but not smart enough to realize that\n\n```\n\tfor (size_t i \u003d 0; i \u003c PWM_CH_COUNT; ++i) {\n\t\tpwm \u003d \u0026pwm_configs[i];\n\t}\n```\n\nwill never do anything because PWM_CH_COUNT \u003d\u003d 0.\n",
